COST OPTIMIZATION & FINOPS (Real-World Scenarios)

These scenarios focus on cloud cost explosions, accountability, and smart optimization decisions.

⸻

💰 Cost Optimization & FinOps – Real-World DevOps Scenarios
 1. Your cloud bill suddenly increased by 40%. How do you investigate the root cause?
 2. Multiple resources are running but not being used. How do you identify and clean them up safely?
 3. How do you implement cost visibility across teams and environments?
 4. Developers keep spinning up large instances. How do you control this?
 5. How do you optimize compute costs without impacting performance?
 6. Storage costs are growing rapidly. How do you analyze and reduce them?
 7. How do you implement budgets and alerts in cloud platforms?
 8. Reserved Instances or Savings Plans are underutilized. How do you fix this?
 9. How do you balance cost vs reliability in production systems?
 10. How do you design cost-efficient architectures across AWS, Azure, and GCP?
 11. How do you enforce cost governance using IaC?
 12. A team refuses to downscale unused resources. How do you handle it?
 13. How do you optimize Kubernetes costs?
 14. How do you implement chargeback or showback models?
 15. How do you measure and report cost optimization success?

